All you need to do is pull the trigger.

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.040
&gt;We’re counting on you.
&gt; Okay.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:19.130
&gt; Core located.
&gt; Now fire!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.620
The cannon has been successfully fired.

00:11:23.620 --> 00:11:24.920
Confirming enemy status.

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:28.800
Shinji... you... you...

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:29.930
You missed!!

00:11:29.930 --> 00:11:32.510
Energy spike from the enemy detected.
Brace for impact!

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:36.330
Colonel, I must inform you that, through
my years of knowledge and expertise

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:39.960
working at this station, I can conclude that we...

00:11:39.960 --> 00:11:40.810
...are fucked.

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:42.690
I must concur with this statement.

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:44.420
Me too, colonel!

00:11:44.420 --> 00:11:45.530
Guys...

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.750
Go fuck yourselves.

00:11:57.370 --> 00:12:00.540
On a scale from 1 to “fucked,”
how fucked are we?

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.880
&gt; I’d say we’re pretty fucked.
&gt; And Shijni?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:04.970
I don’t want to pilot the Eva anymore...
I don’t want to pilot the Eva anymore...

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.330
Very fucked.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.340
Sir... Sir!

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:11.490
I recommend that we switch
to our backup pilot, sir.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:12.220
Think so?

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:14.140
The main pilot’s been compromised.

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:15.560
&gt; We need to—
&gt; No, wait a minute!

00:12:15.560 --> 00:12:17.180
We can’t give up on him yet!

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:23.180
“No matter how bad things get,”

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:25.250
“I trust you’ll do the right thing...”

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.130
Misato?

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:28.530
Shinji! Can you hear me? How are yo—?

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:32.240
I... I remember everything you said, Misato.

00:12:32.240 --> 00:12:35.040
I’ve run away so many times...

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:37.120
from my problems...

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.610
from my fears...

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.040
from everything.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:44.630
But not this time!
Not when everyone’s relying on me.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:45.910
I’m tired!

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:48.090
Tired of people thinking I’m useless!

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:49.730
Tired of running!

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:53.800
Misato! Father! I won’t do it anymore!

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.430
I won’t let you down!!

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:57.930
I won’t run away!

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:01.850
Are you sure?

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:03.650
Yeah...

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.440
Alright.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:06.940
One more time!

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:08.400
[song: Gurren Lagann OST, “Sorairo Days”]

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:09.420
There, lock your position.

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:09.980
Superconductive transformer coming online.
There, lock your position.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.110
Superconductive transformer coming online.

00:13:11.110 --> 00:13:13.180
All cooling systems running at optimal output.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:13.370
Making final stage connections.
All cooling systems running at optimal output.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.120
Making final stage connections.

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:14.900
Switching all firing systems to manual control.
Making final stage connections.

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:16.080
Switching all firing systems to manual control.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:16.550
Starting to charge-up sequence.
Switching all firing systems to manual control.

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:17.170
Starting to charge-up sequence.

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:17.850
Positron cannon magnetic acceleration field stable.
Starting to charge-up sequence.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.610
Positron cannon magnetic acceleration field stable.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:20.220
Power transmission: maintaining maximum voltage.
Positron cannon magnetic acceleration field stable.

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:22.050
Power transmission: maintaining maximum voltage.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:22.960
Usage change complete.

00:13:22.960 --> 00:13:25.530
Evangelion Unit-01 has discarded Type G Equipment.

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:28.430
We’ve got one shot left, Shinji.
Make it count!

00:13:28.430 --> 00:13:29.960
Got it!

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:32.010
Target’s energy readings are on the rise again!

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:33.380
What?! No!

00:13:33.590 --> 00:13:34.010
AH!

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:40.690
Shinji!!

00:13:40.690 --> 00:13:42.400
That wasn’t all talk now, was it?

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:46.150
Ayanami!

00:13:47.900 --> 00:13:50.110
&gt; Shield sustaining heavy damage!
&gt; How much time left?

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:51.940
&gt; He won’t make it!
&gt; NO!

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:55.280
No matter what,
humanity will endure!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:59.320
The Second Impact happened, and we lived!

00:13:59.320 --> 00:14:03.310
The Angels attacked,
and we built the Evangelions!

00:14:03.310 --> 00:14:04.710
We’re here together!

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:06.750
We’ll survive together!!

00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:07.460
Tell them!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:08.960
&gt; Just who...
&gt; the hell...

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:10.550
DO YOU THINK WE ARE?!

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:12.590
This is it, Shinji!

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.930
Do it all for us!

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:15.350
[GRUNTS]

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.280
[ANGEL SCREAMING]

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:43.690
“If you want to cry, then tonight
I will show you how it can rain...”

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:45.180
“with tears of scarlet.”

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:47.880
Rei!

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:04.980
[STRAINING]

00:15:05.520 --> 00:15:08.230
Rei! Are you alright? Rei?!

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.070
[GROANING]

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.940
Oh god... Please don’t tell me you just saved me.

00:15:12.940 --> 00:15:16.160
That’s it? I thought you said we
could have been friends after this.

00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.780
You actually took what I said seriously?

00:15:18.780 --> 00:15:20.740
How else would I?

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:26.330
[CRYING]

00:15:26.330 --> 00:15:28.880
Are you really going to start
crying after everything you did?

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.030
Shut up!

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:32.690
It’s a nervous condition, okay?

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:37.180
You know, if you’re gonna save a girl,
you could buy her dinner first...

00:15:37.180 --> 00:15:39.730
or at least start with some small talk.

00:15:39.730 --> 00:15:43.000
Well, we’ve been some really nice weather recently.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:44.770
I enjoyed the scarlet rain you showed me.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:56.800
Here, let’s go home.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:59.640
You know, I still think you’re a wimp.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:01.910
I guess I was just lucky today.

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.370
&gt; [GASP]
&gt; Finally awake?

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:04.270
&gt; Wha-?
&gt; Good.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:07.250
The Angel’s attacking, humanity is
in danger, your dad’s waiting for you,

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:09.330
and everyone needs you to pilot Unit-01.

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:11.040
It’s time to get in the robot, Ikari.

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:14.710
OH, YOU GOTTA BE FUCKING KIDDING ME!!

00:16:19.050 --> 00:17:07.830
[BLOOPERS]

